ake at\n 0.00 or glottal fry at the sentence terminus. The spectral envelope is over-smoothed, resulting in a           - Prosodic Features: Pitch contours, rhythmic naturalness,\n synthetic 'buzzy' quality during voiced segments like 'developed' and 'palm print' that lacks natural\n harmonic complexity.\n                                                                                                                 emotional weight.\n Prosodic Features: Pitch contours remain unnaturally flat across the complex syntactic structure,              - Spectral Artifacts: Checkerboard patterns, spectral gaps,\n failing to provide the expected intonational dip at the comma after 'powder' or the rising inflection for\n the final clause 'nearest the window.' The rhythmic cadence is mathematically uniform, lacking the              high-frequency anomalies.\n micro-timing variations and stress shifts a human speaker would naturally employ to emphasize the              - Temporal Coherence: Logical energy envelope progres-\n specific location 'top edge of the carton.’</think><answer>Detection Result: 1 Localization Result:\n 0.00-9.85 </answer>                                                                                             sion, speech rate fluctuations, micro-rhythmic jitter, and\n                                                                                                                 amplitude modulation.\n Figure 12: Failure case analysis of a partially fake sample.                                                   - Speaker Consistency: Voiceprint stability, formant trajec-\n                                                                                                                 tory alignment, idiosyncratic pitch range, and timbre uni-\n                                                                                                                 formity.\n      • False Negative (Figure 11): A fully fake sample is misclas-                        